  "slug": "pdca-framework",
  "name": "Pdca Framework",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude guides human-supervised AI code generation through Plan-Do-Check-Act cycles with Test First/TDD discipline. This keeps human engineers accountable, reducing technical debt, and capturing learnings across sessions.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install pdca-framework@claude-community` from `kenjudy/pdca-framework`.\n\nA disciplined framework for AI-assisted code generation using Plan-Do-Check-Act methodology with strict TDD discipline.\n\nClaude guides human-supervised AI code generation through Plan-Do-Check-Act cycles with Test First/TDD discipline. This keeps human engineers accountable, reducing technical debt, and capturing learnings across sessions.",
